# Kodama of the East Tree's ChangesZone trigger carries NotThisAbility$ True
# (TriggerChangesZone.java:161-168): Grizzly Bears entering lets it put
# Ornithopter (mana value 0, at most 2) from the hand onto the battlefield;
# Ornithopter's entry is caused by that same trigger, so it does not fire
# again: the second Ornithopter stays in the hand, no second choice asked.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
queue paygeneric G
queue cardchoice 3
castspell human 2
resolvestack
resolvestack
